        "TileImage": "$($repository 7e243aad-5b1e-48e4-b9cf-aad764256784).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47\r\rFollowing your operation in the Andaman Sea, we’ve learned two lead scientists behind the production remain active. They are overseeing the final stages from a lab in Sapienza.\r\rAn additional complication: an operative from an unknown organization is on-site. His objective is unclear. Eliminate him.\r\rThe last remaining sample remains unfinished. Terminating the scientists will effectively destroy it.\r\rGood hunting, 47",
